{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FunSchulte 是一款以 Schulte 表格訓練周邊視覺的應用，適合想提升閱讀速度、專注力與視覺感知能力的讀者。玩法是視線固定在表格中心，只用周邊視覺依序找出所有數字。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多種表格等級與遊玩統計</h2>\n<p>FunSchulte 內建多個 Schulte 表格等級，並提供 Light 與 Classic 兩種趣味模式，讓訓練節奏可隨意調整。完成一回合的方式是用周邊視覺找出全部數字，視線盡量保持在表格中心，藉此鍛鍊專注力與視覺感知。程式會記錄每回合所花時間並彙整統計數據，另設全球排行榜，亦可自訂表格外觀，方便持續練習。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-544-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-545-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-546-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-547-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-548-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-549-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FunSchulte</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T01:43:55.834521+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}